{
  "feature": "Overview accuracy PR 5: the method-changed notice and the free rewrite (addendum_method_notice 1a to 1f)",
  "note": "Needs a server with ANALYSIS_TAB_ENABLED=true, OVERVIEW_V2_ENABLED=true, SYNOPSIS_STUB_DELAY_MS=7000 and the stub model, signed in as the account the decks belong to. Seed the decks with `PROBE_USER_ID=<clerk id> pnpm probe:method-notice --seed` (local-dev only; it prints the MN_* ids this file reads) and remove them with `--unseed`. The two writing rows and their done rows PRESS the free rewrite, one deck per width, so reseed before a second run. check:shared does not apply: there is no shared-control claim.",
  "out": "contact-sheets/method-notice",
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "eligible",
      "label": "/decks/[id] Analysis: 1a, the method-changed notice over the held overview, with the free note",
